---
description: Superpowers workflow scaled by change size; plan first for non-trivial work; never spawn agents by default
alwaysApply: false
---

Ajoute cette fonctionnalité.

Utilise Superpowers.

Commence par comprendre l'architecture existante et les contraintes
du projet.

Avant toute modification non triviale, présente-moi le plan.

N'implémente rien avant validation du plan.

## Reasoning flow

```
Grok 4.6
    │
    ▼
analyse demande
    │
    ▼
exploration
    │
    ▼
brainstorming
    │
    ▼
plan
    │
    ├── architecture
    ├── tests
    └── code
    │
    ▼
implémentation
    │
    ▼
tests
    │
    ▼
review
    │
    ▼
vérification
```

Do not run this full pipeline for every task.

Do not launch 5 agents by default.

Use subagents only when they can work on independent subjects
and that split provides real value.

## Scale the workflow

### Banale modification

Grok → code → test

No brainstorming ceremony. No extra agents. Keep it lightweight.

### Feature importante

Grok:
- analyse architecture
- implémentation
- review

Present the plan first. Wait for validation before coding.

### Gros changement

Specialized roles, only when the work is large and independent:

- Architecte
- Sécurité / reviewer
- Implémenteur
- Tests
- Validation finale

Launch those agents only when parallel independent work is real.
Do not invent workstreams to fill the diagram.
